Get the latest annual reporting year, latest quarterly reporting quarter and year, and current date in UTC. The output is a dictionary with the following schema::

{
    "annual": {
        "latest_year": int
    },
    "quarterly": {
        "latest_quarter": int,
        "latest_year": int
    },
    "now": {
        "current_year": int,
        "current_quarter": int,
        "current_month": int,
        "current_date": str # in format Y-m-d
    }
}
